    {
      "document_id": "2368",
      "label": "1",
      "explanation": "Senator Craig announces an expansion of VA outpatient clinic services in north central Idaho and explicitly highlights his role in conveying concerns directly to the VA Secretary and the regional director, credit-claiming for securing this benefit for his state under clarification (a) and (c)."
