    {
      "document_id": "805",
      "label": "1",
      "explanation": "Senator Shelby announces federal funding from the Department of Homeland Security for the Homewood Fire Department in Jefferson County, Alabama, explicitly noting his role as a member of the Senate Appropriations Committee. This falls under clarification (a) of the credit-claiming criteria."
