    {
      "document_id": "1897",
      "label": "0",
      "explanation": "Senator Martinez expresses his views and potential filibuster stance on pending energy legislation. This represents pure position-taking on a legislative issue, which is excluded under negative clarification (a)."
    },
    {
      "document_id": "4295",
      "label": "0",
      "explanation": "The primary focus of this press release is Senator Murkowski reintroducing legislation to modify the Medicaid formula. While she mentions past short-term funding victories, the main event of the text is introducing a bill that has not yet passed, which is excluded under negative clarification (b)."
